WEBVTT

00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:04.670
A topic is a theme, such as Education or Agriculture.

00:00:04.670 --> 00:00:07.485
Every FAQ and video belongs to one.

00:00:07.485 --> 00:00:13.598
You'll mostly come here to edit a topic's guided syllabus, its reading list.

00:00:13.598 --> 00:00:17.539
Add a new topic only when CCS starts a new theme.

00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:22.847
In this video, we'll add a practice topic, and write its syllabus.

00:00:23.419 --> 00:00:27.139
Open Topics, and click New Topic.

00:00:27.691 --> 00:00:29.211
Give it a name.

00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:34.169
The URL slug becomes part of the web address.

00:00:34.169 --> 00:00:41.729
Capitals and spaces are refused, so if we type the name as it is and try to publish, the field turns red.

00:00:42.443 --> 00:00:46.860
Use the topic's name in lowercase, with hyphens for spaces.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:52.624
The slug is in the address of the topic, and of every FAQ and video under it.

00:00:52.624 --> 00:00:58.163
So never change it once the topic has FAQs, or all their addresses change.

00:00:58.718 --> 00:01:01.099
So, practice hyphen topic.

00:01:01.099 --> 00:01:05.038
Then a description of one or two sentences.

00:01:05.592 --> 00:01:08.512
Pick the icon closest to the theme.

00:01:10.044 --> 00:01:15.930
Display order sets where the topic sits on the homepage and in the list of topics.

00:01:15.930 --> 00:01:17.724
Lower numbers come first.

00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:20.300
Now the guided syllabus.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:25.480
Follow the pattern the other topics use, so the syllabi read alike.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:31.124
A Heading 2 for each kind of resource, such as Books, or Academic Papers.

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:38.005
Then a numbered list, where each item is the title as a link, then a dash and the author.

00:01:38.561 --> 00:01:40.668
You can write it in either mode.

00:01:40.668 --> 00:01:43.369
Markdown is quicker for a list like this.

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:50.481
Two hashes make a Heading 2, and the link's words go in square brackets, with the address in round brackets.

00:01:51.032 --> 00:01:54.392
Switch back to Rich Text to see it formatted.

00:01:54.946 --> 00:01:56.306
Publish now.

00:02:01.148 --> 00:02:03.899
This is the topic's page on the site.

00:02:03.899 --> 00:02:08.508
Its FAQs and videos appear here once they're given this topic.

00:02:09.218 --> 00:02:12.578
And this is its guided syllabus.

00:02:13.292 --> 00:02:14.269
One warning.

00:02:14.269 --> 00:02:21.519
Before deleting a topic, move its FAQs and videos to another topic, or delete them first.

00:02:21.519 --> 00:02:26.732
Otherwise its FAQ pages stay online, but vanish from every list.

00:02:27.441 --> 00:02:29.881
Next: the glossary.
